  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your gadget possess of a spark of your magical affinity</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tech Sphere, Technomancy Sphere, at least one (gadget) talent</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> One gadget that your create (excluding permanent gadgets and augment grafts) contains a sprite with a permanent duration that cannot be transferred. This sprite replenishes itself after 1 minute if it is dispelled or destroyed. You may change which gadget is affected by this feat in a process that takes 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may take this feat multiple times. Each time, you may select an additional gadget.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
